'''Slatebeard's Forge''' is a Wildhammer blacksmith located in the [[Grim Reaches]], just south of [[Dun Kithas]]. The forge is run by [[Farleg Slatebeard]] and his children, [[Grukson Slatebeard|Grukson]] and [[Margella Slatebeard|Margella]], and [[Ragdan Hammersmith]] sells blacksmithing supplies outside the forge. The Slatebeards have outfitted mountaineers in the Grim Reaches for generations.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|32|Ore Must Flow}}</ref>

